{"speciesId":605,"names":{"fr":"Lewsor","es":"Elgyem","en":"Elgyem","ja":"リグレー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Avec son puissant pouvoir psychique, il peut compresser le cerveau de ses ennemis et déclencher des migraines."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It uses its strong psychic power to squeeze its opponent’s brain, causing unendurable headaches."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est apparu soudainement des confins d’un désert il y a 50 ans. Personne ne l’avait jamais vu auparavant."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"This Pokémon had never been seen until it appeared from far in the desert 50 years ago."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Rumors of its origin are linked to a UFO crash site in the desert 50 years ago."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Rumors of its origin are linked to a UFO crash site in the desert 50 years ago."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Avec son puissant pouvoir psychique, il peut compresser le cerveau de ses ennemis et déclencher des migraines."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Posee un gran poder psíquico. Lo usa para comprimir el cerebro del enemigo y ocasionarle dolores de cabeza."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It uses its strong psychic power to squeeze its opponent’s brain, causing unendurable headaches."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"強力な サイコパワーを 操る。 サイコパワーで 相手の 脳みそを 絞めつけて 頭痛を 起こさせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"On dit qu’il est apparu soudainement il y a 50 ans des confins d’un désert où un OVNI se serait écrasé."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Según cuentan los rumores, procede de un desierto donde hace 50 años se estrelló un ovni."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Rumors of its origin are linked to a UFO crash site in the desert 50 years ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"５０年前 ＵＦＯが 墜落したと うわさされる 砂漠から やってきたと いわれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Avec son puissant pouvoir psychique, il peut compresser le cerveau de ses ennemis et déclencher des migraines."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Posee un gran poder psíquico. Lo usa para comprimir el cerebro del enemigo y ocasionarle dolores de cabeza."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It uses its strong psychic power to squeeze its opponent’s brain, causing unendurable headaches."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"強力な サイコパワーを 操る。 サイコパワーで 相手の 脳みそを 絞めつけて 頭痛を 起こさせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On dit qu’il est apparu soudainement il y a 50 ans des confins d’un désert où un OVNI se serait écrasé."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Según cuentan los rumores, procede de un desierto donde hace 50 años se estrelló un ovni."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Rumors of its origin are linked to a UFO crash site in the desert 50 years ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"５０年前 ＵＦＯが 墜落したと うわさされる 砂漠から やってきたと いわれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il possède de redoutables pouvoirs psychiques. La plupart des signalements d’extraterrestres correspondent à des Lewsor qui se promènent."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Es capaz de usar un formidable poder psíquico. Muchos creen haber avistado extraterrestres cuando, en realidad, lo que vieron eran Elgyem."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It controls tremendous psychic power. Most reports of alien sightings are actually just people mistaking Elgyem for an alien."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"凄まじい サイコパワーを 操る。 宇宙人 目撃情報の 多くは リグレーの 見間違いだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ce Pokémon est nimbé de mystère. On raconte qu’il serait apparu il y a 50 ans, après la chute d’un OVNI."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Pokémon envuelto en un halo de misterio cuya aparición, 50 años atrás, coincide curiosamente con la caída de un ovni."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"This Pokémon is shrouded in mystery. It’s said to have appeared from a UFO that fell from the sky about 50 years ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"およそ ５０年前 地上に 落ちた ＵＦＯから 現れたと いわれる 謎の 多い ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"S’il se tient près d’une télé, d’étranges panoramas apparaissent à l’écran. On raconte qu’il s’agirait de paysages venus des terres natales de Lewsor."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando se halla junto a un televisor, la pantalla muestra imágenes de extraños paisajes. Se cree que corresponden a su lugar de origen."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"If this Pokémon stands near a TV, strange scenery will appear on the screen. That scenery is said to be from its home."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"テレビのそばに いると モニターに 奇妙な 景色が 映る。 リグレーの 故郷だと いわれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon a été découvert il y a environ 50 ans. Son cerveau surdéveloppé lui permet d’utiliser ses pouvoirs psychiques avec aisance."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Fue descubierto hace aproximadamente 50 años. Posee un cerebro muy desarrollado que le otorga poderes psíquicos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon was discovered about 50 years ago. Its highly developed brain enables it to exert its psychic powers."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"５０年 ほど 前に 見つかった ポケモン。 大きく 発達した 脳で サイコパワーを 操るぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":605,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[11,"level-up",18],[14,"level-up",18],[15,"level-up",18],[16,"level-up",18],[17,"level-up",18],[18,"level-up",18],[20,"level-up",30]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[11,"level-up",4],[14,"level-up",4],[15,"level-up",4],[16,"level-up",4],[17,"level-up",4],[18,"level-up",4],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"disable","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0]]},{"name":"psybeam","learns":[[11